<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>财新数据通 - 专享资讯</title><link>https://database.caixin.com/news/</link><atom:link href="http://rsshub.isrss.com/caixin/database" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"></atom:link><description>财新数据通 - 专享资讯 - Powered by RSSHub</description><generator>RSSHub</generator><webMaster>contact@rsshub.app (RSSHub)</webMaster><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 01 Apr 2026 00:28:17 GMT</lastBuildDate><ttl>5</ttl><item><title>【华尔街原声】RBC：若曼德海峡被封锁 中东原油出口将完全停滞</title><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;加拿大皇家银行（RBC）的资本市场大宗商品策略全球主管Helima Croft表示，苏伊士运河对通行船只有严格的尺寸限制，大型油轮无法借道苏伊士运河，只能依赖曼德海峡进出。这意味着在面临航道封锁时，大型油轮缺乏可行的替代路线&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;
  
  
  
  
 &lt;br&gt;&lt;video controls=&quot;&quot; preload=&quot;metadata&quot; poster=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-31/177495571207136.jpg&quot; src=&quot;https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/v0dc35g10000d75p9tiljht557u9lsog&quot;&gt;&lt;/video&gt;&lt;br&gt;
       
      </description><link>https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429614.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429614.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 31 Mar 2026 11:11:15 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>【风电观察】2026年2月风电招标数据环比下降 同比上涨</title><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;2026年2月风电招标数据环比下降44%，同比上涨38%&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;
    &lt;dl class=&quot;media_pic&quot;&gt;
     &lt;dt&gt;&lt;img data-src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-31/177494217205725_840_560.png&quot; class=&quot;cx-img-loader&quot; src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-31/177494217205725_840_560.png&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
     
    &lt;/dl&gt;
   &lt;br&gt;
       
      </description><link>https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429475.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429475.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 31 Mar 2026 07:31:05 GMT</pubDate><author>文｜财新数据 马薇</author></item><item><title>【市场动态】高盛仍看涨黄金 预计年底前金价将达到5400美元</title><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;高盛分析师表示，黄金的中期前景依然稳固，金价可能达到每盎司5400美元，称央行持续购买以及美国今年料再降息两次是主要原因&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;
    &lt;dl class=&quot;media_pic&quot;&gt;
     &lt;dt&gt;&lt;img data-src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2025-12-30/176706555485284_840_560.jpg&quot; class=&quot;cx-img-loader&quot; src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2025-12-30/176706555485284_840_560.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
     &lt;dd&gt;图：视觉中国&lt;/dd&gt;
    &lt;/dl&gt;
   &lt;br&gt;
       
      </description><link>https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429435.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429435.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 31 Mar 2026 06:46:05 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>【市场动态】韩国推出170亿美元追加预算案 应对伊朗战事冲击</title><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;韩国企划预算部周二表示，政府提议追加26.2万亿韩元（173亿美元）的预算，旨在减轻燃料成本飙升带来的负担、支持弱势群体并稳定供应链&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;
    &lt;dl class=&quot;media_pic&quot;&gt;
     &lt;dt&gt;&lt;img data-src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2013-05-20/1369010018342682_840_560.jpg&quot; class=&quot;cx-img-loader&quot; src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2013-05-20/1369010018342682_840_560.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
     
    &lt;/dl&gt;
   &lt;br&gt;
       
      </description><link>https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429438.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429438.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 31 Mar 2026 06:38:43 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>【市场动态】霍尔木兹海峡追踪：特朗普态度反复横跳；科威特油轮在迪拜港遭袭</title><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;战争造成的航运受阻仍在困扰霍尔木兹海峡，前一天仅少量船只通过该水道，主要是与中国或伊朗有关的船只&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;
    &lt;dl class=&quot;media_pic&quot;&gt;
     &lt;dt&gt;&lt;img data-src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-23/177426892861794_840_560.jpg&quot; class=&quot;cx-img-loader&quot; src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-23/177426892861794_840_560.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
     &lt;dd&gt;图：视觉中国&lt;/dd&gt;
    &lt;/dl&gt;
   &lt;br&gt;
       
      </description><link>https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429440.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429440.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 31 Mar 2026 06:31:50 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>【市场动态】亚洲数国干预债市 抑制因能源危机而飙升的收益率</title><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;在亚洲各地，本月债券收益率飙升引发了加码购债，政府纷纷寻求限制能源价格上涨对本地借贷成本的影响&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;
    &lt;dl class=&quot;media_pic&quot;&gt;
     &lt;dt&gt;&lt;img data-src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-24/177434388255710_840_560.jpg&quot; class=&quot;cx-img-loader&quot; src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-24/177434388255710_840_560.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
     &lt;dd&gt;图：IC photo&lt;/dd&gt;
    &lt;/dl&gt;
   &lt;br&gt;
       
      </description><link>https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429466.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429466.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 31 Mar 2026 06:26:05 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>【今日热点】股指震荡走弱 张雪机车关联公司连续大涨</title><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;三大指数均震荡下挫，轨交设备板块领涨，张雪机车夺冠事件带动宏昌科技连续大涨，贵州茅台隔逾两年再提价早盘涨2.33%，存储芯片概念、通信行业大跌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;
    &lt;dl class=&quot;media_pic&quot;&gt;
     &lt;dt&gt;&lt;img data-src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-31/177493203385160_840_560.png&quot; class=&quot;cx-img-loader&quot; src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-31/177493203385160_840_560.png&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
     
    &lt;/dl&gt;
   &lt;br&gt;
       
      </description><link>https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429349.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429349.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 31 Mar 2026 04:37:40 GMT</pubDate><author>文|财新数据 赵甜甜（整理）</author></item><item><title>【市场动态】美元将迎2022年来表现最佳的一个月 投资者在乱世中涌向避风港</title><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;美国作为世界最大石油生产国的地位，也在全球能源价格飙升之际支撑了美元走势，同时全球经济增长预期转弱亦为美元提供助力&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;
    &lt;dl class=&quot;media_pic&quot;&gt;
     &lt;dt&gt;&lt;img data-src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2025-11-07/176248450459356_840_560.jpg&quot; class=&quot;cx-img-loader&quot; src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2025-11-07/176248450459356_840_560.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
     &lt;dd&gt;图：IC photo&lt;/dd&gt;
    &lt;/dl&gt;
   &lt;br&gt;
       
      </description><link>https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429251.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429251.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 31 Mar 2026 02:40:03 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>【市场动态】法律风险叠加AI烧钱 Meta市值蒸发2800亿引发烟草业式风险担忧</title><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;投资者对法律风险以及人工智能(AI)巨额支出的担忧正不断浮现，最终导致Meta上周股价暴跌11%&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;
    &lt;dl class=&quot;media_pic&quot;&gt;
     &lt;dt&gt;&lt;img data-src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-01-13/176830589926536_840_560.jpg&quot; class=&quot;cx-img-loader&quot; src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-01-13/176830589926536_840_560.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
     &lt;dd&gt;Meta公司标志。图：Julien De Rosa/视觉中国&lt;/dd&gt;
    &lt;/dl&gt;
   &lt;br&gt;
       
      </description><link>https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429255.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429255.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 31 Mar 2026 02:35:13 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>【市场动态】伊朗战争引发全球股市避险潮 曾经高歌猛进的芯片股首当其冲</title><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;存储芯片制造商美光科技周一收跌9.9%，盘后跌幅进一步扩大。同业方面，三星电子周二在韩国交易所早盘下跌近5%，SK海力士一度下跌7.7%&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;
    &lt;dl class=&quot;media_pic&quot;&gt;
     &lt;dt&gt;&lt;img data-src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2019-06-27/1561608545441476_840_560.png&quot; class=&quot;cx-img-loader&quot; src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2019-06-27/1561608545441476_840_560.png&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
     
    &lt;/dl&gt;
   &lt;br&gt;
       
      </description><link>https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429253.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429253.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 31 Mar 2026 02:32:03 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>【权益周观察】A股急跌探底后回升 市场量能走弱避险情绪较强</title><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;中东局势的后续走向仍是当前最大不确定性，避险情绪主导市场，短期交投活跃度仍存回落风险。不过国内基本面及资金面环境或对A股形成支撑&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;
    &lt;dl class=&quot;media_pic&quot;&gt;
     &lt;dt&gt;&lt;img data-src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-31/177492164964695_840_560.jpg&quot; class=&quot;cx-img-loader&quot; src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-31/177492164964695_840_560.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
     
    &lt;/dl&gt;
   &lt;br&gt;
       
      </description><link>https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429222.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429222.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 31 Mar 2026 01:49:01 GMT</pubDate><author>文｜财新数据 赵甜甜</author></item><item><title>【市场动态】特朗普施压伊朗重开海峡 威胁“彻底摧毁”关键能源基础设施</title><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;美国总统唐纳德·特朗普在表示即将与伊朗达成协议与警告将加大军事行动之间反复摇摆&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;
    &lt;dl class=&quot;media_pic&quot;&gt;
     &lt;dt&gt;&lt;img data-src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-31/177492107708761_840_560.jpg&quot; class=&quot;cx-img-loader&quot; src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-31/177492107708761_840_560.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
     &lt;dd&gt;资料图：特朗普。图：视觉中国&lt;/dd&gt;
    &lt;/dl&gt;
   &lt;br&gt;
       
      </description><link>https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429210.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429210.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 31 Mar 2026 01:38:08 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>【市场动态】IMF称伊朗战争将推高全球价格并拖累经济增长 或引发不对称冲击</title><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;“所有路径都指向更高的价格和更低的增长，”IMF表示。该机构指出，对供应链和基础设施的最终影响，将取决于冲突持续时间是短是长&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;
    &lt;dl class=&quot;media_pic&quot;&gt;
     &lt;dt&gt;&lt;img data-src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-31/177492137009659_840_560.jpg&quot; class=&quot;cx-img-loader&quot; src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-31/177492137009659_840_560.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
     &lt;dd&gt;随着美军抵达中东，布伦特原油周一飙升，逼近每桶115美元，单月涨幅料创纪录。图：IC photo&lt;/dd&gt;
    &lt;/dl&gt;
   &lt;br&gt;
       
      </description><link>https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429209.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429209.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 31 Mar 2026 01:37:41 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>【市场动态】大豆和豆油期货上涨 追随原油市场涨势</title><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;战争以及霍尔木兹海峡实际上关闭，阻碍了该地区化肥和燃料的运输，并推动谷物和食用油价格上涨&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;
    &lt;dl class=&quot;media_pic&quot;&gt;
     &lt;dt&gt;&lt;img data-src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-31/177492072288266_840_560.jpg&quot; class=&quot;cx-img-loader&quot; src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-31/177492072288266_840_560.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
     &lt;dd&gt;资料图：美国俄亥俄州Waynesfield，农民正在收割大豆。图：视觉中国&lt;/dd&gt;
    &lt;/dl&gt;
   &lt;br&gt;
       
      </description><link>https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429201.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429201.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 31 Mar 2026 01:32:20 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>【市场动态】美国国债扩大涨幅 鲍威尔一席话令交易员改为押注今年降息</title><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;美联储主席杰罗姆·鲍威尔周一表示，特朗普的大规模关税对物价的影响是一次性的，而美联储对诸如油价飙升造成的供给面冲击几乎无能为力&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;
    &lt;dl class=&quot;media_pic&quot;&gt;
     &lt;dt&gt;&lt;img data-src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-31/177492082520574_840_560.jpg&quot; class=&quot;cx-img-loader&quot; src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-31/177492082520574_840_560.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
     &lt;dd&gt;当地时间2026年3月30日，美国马萨诸塞州剑桥市，美联储主席杰罗姆·鲍威尔在哈佛大学向学生发表讲话。图：视觉中国&lt;/dd&gt;
    &lt;/dl&gt;
   &lt;br&gt;
       
      </description><link>https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429200.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-31/102429200.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 31 Mar 2026 01:30:51 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>【研报精华】报告显示居民对“打破刚兑”仍存认知短板 AI金融投教应用尚处初期</title><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;在资管新规推出七年、全面落地四年后，仍有超过三成受访者认为机构承诺“保本保收益”是合规的&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;
    &lt;dl class=&quot;media_pic&quot;&gt;
     &lt;dt&gt;&lt;img data-src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-30/177488292049320_840_560.png&quot; class=&quot;cx-img-loader&quot; src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-30/177488292049320_840_560.png&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
     
    &lt;/dl&gt;
   &lt;br&gt;
       
      </description><link>https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-30/102429159.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-30/102429159.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 30 Mar 2026 15:03:40 GMT</pubDate><author>文｜财新数据 赵甜甜</author></item><item><title>【行业速递】中东铝厂遭袭促涨国际铝价 A股铝企谁更具优势</title><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;中东铝厂遭袭导致国际铝价上涨，为A股铝业上市公司上涨提供了贝塔。板块内公司涨幅不等，涨势最好的天山铝业则叠加了自身阿尔法——一季度业绩预告净利润大增&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;
    &lt;dl class=&quot;media_pic&quot;&gt;
     &lt;dt&gt;&lt;img data-src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-30/177488260377452_840_560.jpg&quot; class=&quot;cx-img-loader&quot; src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2026-03-30/177488260377452_840_560.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
     
    &lt;/dl&gt;
   &lt;br&gt;
       
      </description><link>https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-30/102429155.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://database.caixin.com/2026-03-30/102429155.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 30 Mar 2026 14:57:58 GMT</pubDate><author>文｜财新数据 任蕙兰</author></item><item><title>【华尔街原声】美股一周前瞻：3月非农报告 苹果迎50周年里程碑</title><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;美国国家航空航天局（NASA）阿尔忒弥斯2号最早可能在4月1日迎来发射窗口。若发射条件成熟，宇航员将开启绕月飞行任务&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;
  
  
  
  
